    "updated_at": "2017-07-05T12:31:55Z",
    "body": "Cheers! I figured someone must have already picked up on this.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/media.html#loading-the-media-resource contradicts the canvas spec on this:\r\n\r\n> It can be CORS-same-origin or CORS-cross-origin; this affects whether subtitles referenced in the media data are exposed in the API and, for video elements, whether a canvas gets tainted when the video is drawn on it.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
